ides business support services; owns commercial properties and IT spaces; and develops property for micro, small, and medium enterprises, as well as residential complexes. The company was incorporated in 1900 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","employees":724,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1788912000,"asOf":1795440398},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795440398,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Empire Industries\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Empire Ind Investor Analysis | StockIQ","s":"The Economic Times","d":1795161600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNWXpzbmluVU0zMXJERjFESGp5dGNGM1MzbHBySUF5YmlUQ0NIWnRyUWthOHJwYjkybi1ibWRvOGQ4RjZyWGo0YjJNeHNibFowbnZGamg0ZXZuSEtfM2F4Y2dPOGc1MkxvaXlqZG9GMkpGSmpmSFJ4dC1SV004V1M0cXAwd2Etb2IydldYc2FlUXpObjQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Empire Industries Ltd Faces Technical Momentum Shift Amid Mixed Market Signals","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1794432398,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Empire Industries Q2 Results FY27: PAT Jumps 42.78% to Rs 17.69 Cr, Revenue Rs 193.73 Cr","s":"Univest","d":1794391740,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFBjWVRFY0pMOVp6YUNMVEpUTzVrZGI1T1NvQ0ZRRzcyM180SlpJWDl3NC1sNmlSc0RIZS1qelY4cjVOTWhQb1ZsdUo1RFZnUENQSUdreXlvU2czTUlsSmsyZXhJeWR3TFFMelhNMHVYS2ZJNmtRYzF3OWpNaw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Barry HALEY Obituary","s":"The Press Democrat","d":1792891653,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9MVkxMeEdtMTF4MkxwWEVJcDhmWlpzeURXRmptaGczZXBFNV9QeDZQVHR6WWNxNEUyWjhsRHhjZ2lxUnV3VVNrQ1pZcUUxM0FhNG00enU2TFJ6NmxMdTBUTzcxeV83OEstaXdkaDlhcw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Empire Industries Ltd is Rated Hold by MarketsMOJO","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1789966212,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNRE0yNEZaX3FLU2x5b1p2TkVuaG1GUGNPb0FxMl90ZERpMDdxTFZ1RmdCdl9HNWg2Vy1jN3ZpZTBXOHFrd0hIZ1JmLTRpelVfdEhIS09aYXVVVFpBekhWSnRsekN6aWpyVTdnYnl1dC1kR2dQUnZhRE5PNG9qekJYVktDLXVhLVJrOTZYTW9paXNBTTkzYn